        "original_id": "ff2b4c18-d362-566a-9bac-6d22d8d6f5c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gustavo Rodolfo Mendoza Hernández, Pope Francis, Lando, Gregory III\n- Roles: Pope\n- Topics: papal firsts, resignation\n\nFacts:\n- On 11 November 2016, Gustavo Rodolfo Mendoza Hernández resigned to Pope Francis citing his age.\n- Pope Francis is the first Jesuit pope.\n- Pope Francis is the first pope from the Americas.\n- Pope Francis is the first pope from the Southern Hemisphere.\n- Pope Francis is the first pope to choose a name not used by a predecessor since Lando in 913 AD.\n- Pope Francis is the first pope from outside Europe since the Syrian Gregory III, who reigned in the 8th century.",
